#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:2
msgid "How to use custom URL redirects in documentation projects"
msgstr "如何在文档项目中使用自定义 URL 重定向"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:4
msgid ""
"In this guide, you will learn the steps necessary to configure your Read the"
" Docs project for redirecting visitors from one location to another."
msgstr "本指南讲解配置 Read the Docs 项目、将访问者从一个位置重定向到另一位置所需的步骤。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:7
msgid ""
"User-defined redirects are issued by our servers when a reader visits an "
"*old URL*, which means that the reader is automatically redirected to a *new"
" URL*."
msgstr "当读者访问*旧 URL* 时，我们的服务器会发出用户自定义重定向，即读者被自动重定向到* 新 URL* 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:12
msgid ":doc:`/guides/best-practice/links`"
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/best-practice/links`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:13
msgid ""
"The need for a redirect often comes from external links to your "
"documentation. Read more about handling links in this explanation of best "
"practices."
msgstr "重定向的需求通常来自指向你文档的外部链接。更多链接处理内容见这篇最佳实践讲解。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:16
msgid ":doc:`/user-defined-redirects`"
msgstr ":doc:`/user-defined-redirects`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:17
msgid ""
"If you want to know more about our implementation of redirects, you can look"
" up more examples in our reference before continuing with the how-to."
msgstr "若想更多了解我们的重定向实现，可在继续本操作指南前查阅参考文档中的更多示例。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:21
msgid "Adding a redirect rule"
msgstr "添加重定向规则"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:23
msgid ""
"Redirects are configured in the project dashboard, go to your project's "
":menuselection:`Settings --> Redirects`."
msgstr "重定向在项目仪表盘中配置，请前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Redirects` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:26
msgid "Screenshot of the Redirects settings page"
msgstr "重定向设置页面截图"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:29
msgid ""
"After clicking :guilabel:`Add redirect`, you need to select a "
":guilabel:`Redirect Type`. This is where things get a bit more complicated "
"you need to fill in specific information according to that choice."
msgstr ""
"点击 :guilabel:`Add redirect` 后，需要选择 :guilabel:`Redirect Type` "
"。这里会稍复杂一些——你需要根据所选类型填写特定信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:34
msgid "Choosing a :guilabel:`Redirect Type`"
msgstr "选择 :guilabel:`Redirect Type`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:36
msgid ""
"There are different types of redirect rules targeting different needs. For "
"each choice in :guilabel:`Redirect Type`, the form shows a **preview** of "
"the final rule generated as you fill in the fields."
msgstr ""
"有不同类型的重定向规则以满足不同需求。对 :guilabel:`Redirect Type` "
"中的每个选项，表单都会在你填写字段时显示最终规则的**预览** 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:40
msgid "Screenshot of the \"Add redirect\" form with the redirect preview"
msgstr "带重定向预览的\"添加重定向\"表单截图"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:43
msgid ""
"Here is a quick overview of the options available in :guilabel:`Redirect "
"Type`:"
msgstr "以下是 :guilabel:`Redirect Type` 中可用选项的简要说明："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:45
msgid "Page redirect"
msgstr "页面重定向"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:46
msgid ""
"With this option, you can specify a page in your documentation to redirect "
"elsewhere. The rule triggers no matter the version of your documentation "
"that the user is visiting. This rule can also redirect to another website."
msgstr "使用此选项可指定文档中的某个页面重定向到别处。无论用户访问的是哪个文档版本，该规则都会触发。此规则也可重定向到其他网站。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:51
msgid "Read more about this option in :ref:`user-defined-redirects:Page redirects`"
msgstr "有关此选项的更多内容见 :ref:`user-defined-redirects:Page redirects`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:53
msgid "Exact redirect"
msgstr "精确重定向"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:54
msgid ""
"With this option, you can specify a page in your documentation to redirect "
"elsewhere. The rule is specific to the language and version of your "
"documentation that the user is visiting. This rule can also redirect to "
"another website."
msgstr "使用此选项可指定文档中的某个页面重定向到别处。该规则针对用户访问的语言和版本生效。此规则也可重定向到其他网站。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:59
msgid "Read more about this option in :ref:`user-defined-redirects:Exact redirects`"
msgstr "有关此选项的更多内容见 :ref:`user-defined-redirects:Exact redirects`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:61
msgid "Clean URL to HTML"
msgstr "简洁 URL 转 HTML"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:62
msgid ""
"If you choose to change the style of your URLs from *clean URLs* "
"(``/en/latest/tutorial/``) to *HTML URLs* (``/en/latest/tutorial.html``), "
"you can redirect all mismatches automatically."
msgstr ""
"若你决定把 URL 风格从*简洁 URL* （``/en/latest/tutorial/`` ）改为 *HTML URL* "
"（``/en/latest/tutorial.html`` ），可自动重定向所有不匹配的情况。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:65
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:72
msgid ""
"Read more about this option in :ref:`user-defined-redirects:Clean/HTML URLs "
"redirects`"
msgstr "有关此选项的更多内容见 :ref:`user-defined-redirects:Clean/HTML URLs redirects`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:67
msgid "HTML to clean URL"
msgstr "HTML 转简洁 URL"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:68
msgid ""
"Similarly to the former option, if you choose to change the style of your "
"URLs from *HTML URLs* (``/en/latest/tutorial.html``) to *clean URLs* "
"(``/en/latest/tutorial/``), you can redirect all mismatches automatically."
msgstr ""
"与上一个选项类似，若你决定把 URL 风格从 *HTML URL* （``/en/latest/tutorial.html`` ）改为* 简洁 URL*"
" （``/en/latest/tutorial/`` ），可自动重定向所有不匹配的情况。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:76
msgid ""
"By default, redirects are followed only if the requested page doesn't exist "
"(*404 File Not Found* error). If you need to apply a redirect for files that"
" exist, you can have a :guilabel:`Force redirect` option visible. **This "
"option is only available on some plan levels**. Please ask support to enable"
" it for you."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，仅当请求的页面不存在（*404 File Not Found* 错误）时才执行重定向。若需要对已存在的文件应用重定向，可显示 "
":guilabel:`Force redirect` 选项。**此选项仅在部分套餐等级提供** ，请联系支持为你启用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:85
msgid "Defining the redirect rule"
msgstr "定义重定向规则"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:87
msgid ""
"As mentioned before, you can pick and choose a :guilabel:`Redirect Type` "
"that fits your redirect need. When you have entered a :guilabel:`From URL` "
"and :guilabel:`To URL` and the redirect preview looks good, you are ready to"
" save the rule."
msgstr ""
"如前所述，你可以挑选适合自身需求的 :guilabel:`Redirect Type` 。填写 :guilabel:`From URL` 和 "
":guilabel:`To URL` 且重定向预览无误后，即可保存规则。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:93
msgid "Saving the redirect"
msgstr "保存重定向"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:95
msgid ""
"The redirect is not activated before you click :guilabel:`Save`. Before "
"clicking, you are free to experiment and preview the effects. Your redirect "
"rules is added and effective immediately after saving it."
msgstr "在点击 :guilabel:`Save` 之前重定向不会生效。点击前你可以自由试验并预览效果。保存后重定向规则即被添加并立即生效。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:99
msgid ""
"After adding the rule, you can add more redirects as needed. There are no "
"immediate upper bounds to how many redirect rules a project may define."
msgstr "添加规则后，你可以按需添加更多重定向。项目可定义的重定向规则数量暂无即时上限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:104
msgid "Editing and deleting redirect rules"
msgstr "编辑和删除重定向规则"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:106
msgid ""
"You can always revisit your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Redirects` in order to delete a rule or edit it."
msgstr "你可以随时返回项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Redirects` 删除或编辑规则。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:109
msgid ""
"When editing a rule, you can change its :guilabel:`Redirect Type` and its "
":guilabel:`From URL` or :guilabel:`To URL`."
msgstr ""
"编辑规则时，你可以更改其 :guilabel:`Redirect Type` 以及 :guilabel:`From URL` 或 "
":guilabel:`To URL` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:113
msgid "Changing the order of redirects"
msgstr "更改重定向顺序"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:115
msgid ""
"The order of redirects is important, if you have multiple rules that match "
"the same URL, the first redirect in the list will be used."
msgstr "重定向顺序很重要，若有多条规则匹配同一 URL，将使用列表中的第一条重定向。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:119
msgid ""
"You can change the order of the redirect from your project's "
":menuselection:`Settings --> Redirects`, by using the up and down arrow "
"buttons."
msgstr "你可以在项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Redirects` 中用上下箭头按钮更改重定向顺序。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/redirects.rst:122
msgid ""
"New redirects are added at the start of the list (i.e. they have the highest"
" priority)."
msgstr "新重定向会添加到列表开头（即优先级最高）。"

